="55",="55.1303","New",no,"Reserved.","Reserved for use by Statistics Canada. This CIP code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="55",="55.1304","New",no,"Reserved.","Reserved for use by Statistics Canada. This CIP code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="55",="55.1399","New",no,"Reserved.","Reserved for use by Statistics Canada. This CIP code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
