="55",="55.1401","New",no,"Reserved.","Reserved for use by Statistics Canada. This CIP code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="55",="55.1403","New",no,"Reserved.","Reserved for use by Statistics Canada. This CIP code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="55",="55.1404","New",no,"Reserved.","Reserved for use by Statistics Canada. This CIP code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
