="60",="60.07","New",no,"Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Programs.","Instructional content for this group of programs is defined in codes 60.0701 - 60.0799. These CIP codes are not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0701","New",no,"Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program, General.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in nursing. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0702","New",no,"Combined Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in two or more nursing specialties. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0703","New",no,"Acute Care Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in acute care medicine. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0704","New",no,"Adult/Gerontology Acute Care Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in adult/gerontology acute care medicine. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0705","New",no,"Adult/Gerontology Critical Care Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in adult/gerontology critical care medicine. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0706","New",no,"Cardiology/Cardiovascular Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in cardiology and cardiovascular medicine. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0707","New",no,"Clinical Informatics Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in clinical informatics. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0708","New",no,"Dermatology Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in dermatology. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0709","New",no,"Developmental and Behavioral Pediatrics Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in developmental and behavioral pediatrics. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0710","New",no,"Diabetes Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in diabetology and metabolic disorders. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0711","New",no,"Emergency Medicine Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in emergency medicine. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0712","New",no,"Endocrinology Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in endocrinology. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0713","New",no,"Family Medicine Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in family medicine. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0714","New",no,"Gastroenterology and Hepatology Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in gastroenterology and hepatology. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0715","New",no,"Gastroenterology Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in gastroenterology. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0716","New",no,"Genetics Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in genetic counseling and disorders. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0717","New",no,"Gerontology Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in gerontology. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0718","New",no,"Global Health Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in global health. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0719","New",no,"Hematology-Oncology Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in hematology and oncology. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0720","New",no,"Hepatology Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in hepatology. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
