="60",="60.0732","New",no,"Orthopedic Surgery Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in orthopedic surgery. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
="60",="60.0733","New",no,"Pain Management Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in pain management. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
