="60",="60.0735","New",no,"Pediatric Hematology-Oncology Nurse Practitioner Residency/Fellowship Program.","A residency or fellowship program for licensed nurse practitioners that provides advanced didactic and clinical training in pediatric hematology and oncology. This CIP Code is not valid for IPEDS reporting.","",
